<title>PERU: TABLE - Peru's UCP Backus 6-mo net.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Peru's UCP Backus 6-mo net.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The brewery group UCP Backus, which was formed  December 31, 1996 from four breweries owned by the Backus group, reported  Friday its first financial results for the January to June period.</p>
<p>Share - N.A.</p>
<p>Net - 46.9 million soles</p>
<p>Revs - 442.6 million soles</p>
<p>NOTE: The Backus group merged its sister companies Backus y Johnston,  Compania Nacional de Cerveza, Sociedad Cervecera de Trujillo SA and  Cerveceria del Norte. The full name of the new company is Union de  Cervecerias Peruanas Backus y Johnston SA.</p>
<p>((-- Saul Hudson, Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
